    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore Two Loop Patterns\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Compare how different prompts lead to different loop examples.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**1. Prompt AI Tutor.**\r\n\r\n* Ask AI Tutor for a short loop example where a player takes 5 free throws.\r\n* Copy the output into `notes.md`.\r\n\r\n**2. Change your wording.**\r\n\r\n* Ask AI Tutor for a short loop example where a player keeps shooting until they make a basket.\r\n* Copy the output into `notes.md`.\r\n\r\n**3. Record what changed.**\r\n\r\n* In `notes.md`, record the prompts you used and what changed.",
